  "id": "r190cc-a-sheared-skylight-basin",
  "title": "SHEARED SKYLIGHT BASIN — asymmetric three-dimensional inhabited canyon",
  "designIntent": {
    "spatialExperience": "A generous street-concourse base rises into a single sheared load-bearing silhouette. Its hollow vertical daylight canyon and detached-looking but genuinely fused sky crown create changing scale from ground, side and skyline.",
    "silhouette": "The section is not a sequence of 2D octagonal profiles; physically rotated volumes jointly form a diagonal wing, irregularly bulging tower core and off-axis massive public crown. Cuts should open large volumes in more than one viewpoint.",
    "failureToAvoid": "Reject if dense horizontal floor bands, a blocky taper, hidden voids or thin tacked-on ribbons dominate the skyline. Interior office floor proxies, protected air and the already-author-written circulation must not be fabricated."
  },
